# FSCAN 请求格式 (从 pcap 20260416_171917_9996.pcap 提取)

## 设备信息
- mfid: 53090001140012
- equid: 51cd8dfe-e543-40c9-bdc3-a292766fee7f
- funcid: 15 (B_FScan)

## RMCP 帧结构
- RMCPTP Header: 18 bytes
- dwLength: 699
- nVersion: 7
- nMsgType: 90 (REQUEST)
- nFlags: 0x01

## SOAP XML 格式 (完整参数)

```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="gb2312" ?>
<action id="1">
    <parameter groups="1" stationid="53090001" deviceid="00106" devicename="MS845" funcid="15">
        <group index="0">
            <item name="startfreq" value="137MHz" />
            <item name="stopfreq" value="173MHz" />
            <item name="step" value="25kHz" />
            <item name="gainctrl" value="AGC" />
            <item name="rfworkmode" value="0" />
            <item name="scanmode" value="0" />
            <item name="antpol" value="垂直" />
            <item name="antetype" value="OFF" />
            <item name="ifatt" value="0" />
        </group>
    </parameter>
    <other_param />
</action>
```

## 关键差异 (vs emulated_atom 发送)

| 字段 | 真实客户端 | emulated_atom (错误) |
|------|-----------|---------------------|
| startfreq | `137MHz` | `137000000Hz` |
| stopfreq | `173MHz` | `173000000Hz` |
| step | `25kHz` | `25000Hz` |
| gainctrl | `AGC` | ❌ 缺少 |
| rfworkmode | `0` | ❌ 缺少 |
| scanmode | `0` | ❌ 缺少 |
| antpol | `垂直` | ❌ 缺少 |
| antetype | `OFF` | ❌ 缺少 |
| ifatt | `0` | ❌ 缺少 |

## 设备支持的参数 (来自 53090001140012_51cd8dfe-e543-40c9-bdc3-a292766fee7f.xml)

### B_FScan 参数定义:
1. **startfreq** (double): 起始频率, 默认 137MHz, 范围 20MHz ~ 6GHz
2. **stopfreq** (double): 终止频率, 默认 173MHz, 范围 20MHz ~ 8GHz
3. **step** (String): 步进, 可选值: 3.125kHz, 6.25kHz, 12.5kHz, 25kHz, 50kHz, 100kHz
4. **gain** (String): 增益模式, 可选值: AGC, MGC
5. **rfworkmode** (String): 射频模式, 可选值: 0(宽带), 1(选频), 2(选频衰减)
6. **scanmode** (String): 扫描模式, 可选值: 0(普通), 1(精确)

## streamsrc 回调格式

设备响应后, streamsrc 会推送 1086B 帧:
- Sync: 0xEEEEEEEE
- Header: 44 bytes (offset 4-47)
- Metadata: 7 × int16 (offset 48-61)
- Spectrum: 512 × int16 (offset 62+)

## 回调 SOAP Response 格式

```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/" xmlns:srrc="http://www.srrc.org.cn">
<soapenv:Body><srrc:responsebody>
<srrc:result><srrc:success>true</srrc:success></srrc:result>
<srrc:taskid>{taskid}</srrc:taskid>
<srrc:outputchannel>
    <srrc:mode>source</srrc:mode>
    <srrc:datachannel>stream</srrc:datachannel>
    <srrc:host>127.0.0.1</srrc:host>
    <srrc:port>18013</srrc:port>
    <srrc:stc>12345678</srrc:stc>
</srrc:outputchannel>
</srrc:responsebody></soapenv:Body></soapenv:Envelope>
```
